sequenceDiagram
  participant TX as Transaction
  participant RPC as RPC Gateway
  participant PIL as Policy Engine
  participant REG as Compliance Registry
  TX->>RPC: Submit
  RPC->>PIL: Preflight evaluate
  PIL->>REG: Load policy + jurisdiction
  REG-->>PIL: Policy pack + jurisdiction
  PIL-->>RPC: Decision (ALLOW/WARN/BLOCK)
  RPC-->>TX: Allow or reject with correlationId
